NOT COVERED BY THIS LICENCE
---------------------------
Rights in the source articles (Pochvovedenie; Springer / Eurasian Soil Science)
remain with their publishers and authors. This repository distributes extracted
numeric values, provenance locators and pointers to the source, not the
articles themselves.

